25],[28019,20.6,1974,54,104,26],[28020,21.0,1974,57,103,27]],"links":[["Todd County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/south-dakota/todd-county"],["ARC or PLC in Todd County","/arc-plc/south-dakota/todd-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years back to 1951, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 15 grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years. In 2025 that middle ran 145% of normal in August to September but only 52% in October to November. So far in 2026 it sat at 34% in February to March and 125% in June to July. Grid 27416 had its driest year in 1989 at 55%.</p>"}
